{"model":"gpt-4o-mini","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Given the following text by a user, extract the part\nthat is actually relevant to their question. Include\nthe actual question or query that the user is asking.\n\nText by user:\nMary has 3 times as much candy as Megan.\nMary then adds 10 more pieces of candy to her collection.\nMax is 5 years older than Mary.\nIf Megan has 5 pieces of candy, how many does Mary have in total?"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"relevantContext":{"type":"string","description":"All numerical facts and operations from the text that are needed to answer the question \u2014 do not omit any numbers or math steps"},"userQuery":{"type":"string","description":"The exact question from the user"}},"required":["relevantContext","userQuery"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}}}